 "triennialUpdates": {
  "description": "Art. 138.º CIMI: every three years after its last valuation or update, the VPT of a property is multiplied by the currency devaluation coefficient (CDM) of that year, taken from the yearly IRS/IRC portaria. Housing, building land and other properties get 75% of the update (n.º 2); commerce, industry and services get all of it (n.º 1). Each entry is the update made in `year` (it counts for that tax year) to properties last valued or updated in `cdmYear`.",
